ance that landed on Karlan has made them aggressive and agile. They can perform flips, turns, 180-degree about-faces, and triple rolls.","abilities":["Loses all DEF and RES and becomes unable to move for some time on colliding with high ground"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":700,"def":3200,"res":80,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"blackhorn_rhuul":{"slug":"blackhorn_rhuul","name":"Blackhorn Rhuul","icon":"/enemies-icons/Blackhorn Rhuul.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Sturdy burdenbeasts with massive horns on their heads. The influence of the mysterious substance that landed on Karlan has turned their horns black. The Saintess said: Once upon a time, there was a girl who, finding the sight of others accompanied by their pets endearing, wanted a pet of her own. She thought she should first give it a name...","abilities":["[Clash of Brawn] Performs Charged Attacks and tries to push units that block it","After charging, deals damage to the target and pushes it back one tile; if unable to push, deals more damage and stuns the target for several seconds","Charge can be interrupted by negative statuses like Stun and Shift"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":20000,"atk":1000,"def":800,"res":30,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":5}}},"dropIcons":{"4002":"/item-icons/originite_prime.png"},"previewFile":"os-s-2.webp","emergency":null,"devices":[{"col":5,"description":"Enemies increase the Avalanche Warning Index when entering the Avalanche Area Deploying Operators within the area will also increase the Index's value","hidden":false,"key":"trap_265_xdice1","kind":"device","name":"Saintess Statue","row":4}],"playbackPaths":{"1":{"points":[[10,4],[9,4],[8,4],[7,4],[6,4],[6,3]],"distances":[0,1,2,3,4